{
  "name": "Meeting: Survival Kit",
  "shortName": "meeting-survival-kit",
  "description": "Survive your meetings",
  "story": [
    "Some moments in a video call deserve a drum roll, others just awkward crickets. 🥁",
    "Meeting: Survival Kit is 17 stock sound effects for exactly those moments — an airhorn when the quarter closes, a sad trombone when it doesn't, and elevator music for the fifteenth minute of \"can everyone see my screen?\".",
    "Keep it open in a second tab. One tap plays, the keyboard works as a shortcut, and it still runs once the Wi-Fi gives up.",
    "Use responsibly. Everyone on the call can hear it too."
  ],
